  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: (87 * 63) * 6 *1 * 5\n\nAccording to the question, after replace the * signs:\n\nOption 1) + ÷ × =\n\n(87 * 63) * 6 *1 * 5 ⇒ (87 + 63) ÷ 6 × 1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**(87 + 63)**__ ÷ 6 × 1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**150 ÷ 6**__ × 1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**25 **____**× **____**1**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 25 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) - ÷ + =\n\n(87 * 63) * 6 *1 * 5 ⇒ (87 - 63) ÷ 6 +1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**(87 - 63)**__ ÷ 6 +1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 6**__ +1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**4 +1**__ = 5\n\n⇒** 5 = 5 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) ÷ + × =\n\n(87 * 63) * 6 *1 * 5 ⇒ (87 ÷ 63) + 6 × 1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**(87 ÷ 63)**__ + 6 × 1 = 5\n\n⇒ 1.38 + __**6 × 1**__ = 5\n\n⇒ __**1.38 + 6**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 7.38 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) × + ÷ =\n\n(87 * 63) * 6 *1 * 5 ⇒ (87 × 63) + 6 ÷ 1 = 5\n\n⇒ __**(87 ×**____** 63)**__ + 6 ÷ 1 = 5\n\n⇒ 5481 + __**6 ÷ 1**__ = 5\n\n⇒ __**5481**____** + 6**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 5487 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
